Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:56.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(526,513)\blur5}愛してるって何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.03,0:01:00.78,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,476)\blur5}辞書を引いてもピンと来なくて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:05.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,430)\blur5\fad(200,200)}そうね、愛って何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:11.96,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,520)}語り尽くせぬこの痛みが愛なんかも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:17.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(524,500)}始まりの対に終わりを創る
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:22.14,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}神様はとても残酷だよね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:27.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}人間はきっと勇敢なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:27.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fs35\pos(780,2)}ぼくら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:32.32,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,516)}終わりを知れどまだ前へ進むから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:37.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}何を引き換えにしようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:42.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}何度だって汚すよこの手なら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:47.21,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}後悔に似た罪の意識
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:52.25,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}隠して歩む道は何処へと続くの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:01:57.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつか君が死んじゃうって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:02:00.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}想像するだけで痛いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:03.56,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)}心臓を握りつぶすのは誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:03.56,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)\fs35\pos(770,2)}こころ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:05.72,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,200)}キミが愛なんだろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:08.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつか二人を引き離す終わりが
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.44,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}迎えに来ようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:15.90,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}誰も追いつけやしないスピードで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:20.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}どこまでも逃げてみせるよ
Comment: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,————OPCN————
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:56.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fsp4\fad(526,513)\blur5\fad(200,200)}永恆的愛到底是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.03,0:01:00.78,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,476)\blur5\fad(200,200)\fsp4}翻遍字典都毫無頭緒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:05.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,430)\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}是啊、愛到底是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:11.96,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,520)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}或許這份道不清說不明的痛楚便是愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:17.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(524,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}有開始便會創造結束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:22.14,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}神明真是殘忍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:27.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}作為人類的我們定是生性勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:32.32,OPCN,,0,0,10,,{\blur5\fad(200,516)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}即便知道會走向結束也不斷邁步前行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:37.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}無論付出什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:42.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}這雙骯髒的雙手早已
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:47.21,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}充斥著無異於遺憾的罪惡感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:52.25,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}隱藏的道路將會延續到何處
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:01:57.63,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}一想起你總有一天會死去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:02:00.89,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}我就萬分痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:03.56,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}讓我心碎的人究竟是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:05.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}你便是所謂的愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:08.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}儘管會將二人分離的結局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}始終都會來臨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:15.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}我也會以迅雷不及掩耳之勢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:20.03,OPCN,,0,0,5,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}逃脫給你看
Comment: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,————EDJP————
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:11.22,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:14.10,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Goodbye old self goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:26.40,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Now it’s time for me to take a breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.74,0:22:31.20,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You know I don’t want to lose anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:35.45,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Don’t wanna see the end I need this more
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.71,0:22:40.29,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I want to feel the warmth I can’t let go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:44.46,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not gonna give it up because I know my strength
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.88,0:22:49.43,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’m barely breathing but I’m keepin’ up to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:55.68,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:59.60,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}I hide my trembling hand and just keep pushin’ on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:04.86,EDEN,,0,0,1,,{\fad(200,200)}Cause the things I need to guard gives me the power to conquer carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:06.74,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Goodbye old self
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:11.45,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Never going back to the me I fought to leave behind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:14.62,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Hello new me, this time
Comment: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,————EDCN————
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:11.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我已決定變得比周遭都堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:14.10,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再見  曾經的我  再也不見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:26.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}是時候讓我深吸一口氣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.74,0:22:31.20,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我什麼都不想失去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:35.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}只有更加努力才能避免最壞的結局
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.71,0:22:40.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}想感受無法釋懷的溫存
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:44.46,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我深知我的無力  因而我永不言棄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.88,0:22:49.43,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}就算快要窒息  我也要守護住現在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:55.68,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我已決定變得比周遭都堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:59.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我必須藏起顫抖的手  繼續前行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:04.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}因為我要守護的東西給了我戰勝怯弱的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:06.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再見  曾經的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:11.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再也不會變回那個我努力拋之於後的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:14.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}你好  新生的我  此時此刻
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,————Screen————
